{"id":"c3fc2cb31dd5754f","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-essential-extension.md","title":"Essential Extension","display":"df-essential-extension — Essential Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-essential-extension","aliases":["58-df-essential-extension"],"display":"df-essential-extension — Essential Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-essential-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-essential-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-essential-extension — Essential Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4deff85a84639467\" href=\"?note=4deff85a84639467\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md\">../batch07/58-df-submodule.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,E,M,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal E,E,M,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E=\\langle E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal E=\\langle E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(M;E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\">\\(\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(M;E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4deff85a84639467\" href=\"?note=4deff85a84639467\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md\">../batch07/58-df-submodule.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssentialExtension}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{EssentialExtension}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}essential\\text{-}extension}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{EssentialExtension}_S(M,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal E=\\langle E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(M;E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall N\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land N\\neq\\{0_E\\}\\to N\\cap M\\neq\\{0_E\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}essential\\text{-}extension}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{EssentialExtension}_S(M,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal E=\\langle E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(M;E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall N\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land N\\neq\\{0_E\\}\\to N\\cap M\\neq\\{0_E\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M \\subseteq_e E\">\\(M \\subseteq_e E\\)</span> means every nonzero submodule of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> intersects <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> nontrivially.</li>\n<li>Injective envelope <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(M)\">\\(E(M)\\)</span> is the smallest essential extension that is injective.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(M)\">\\(E(M)\\)</span> is unique up to isomorphism over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Also called injective hull or injective closure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md","status":"resolved","id":"4deff85a84639467","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md","status":"resolved","id":"4deff85a84639467","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(M;E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E,E,M,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E=\\langle E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(M;E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssentialExtension}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}essential\\text{-}extension}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{EssentialExtension}_S(M,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\exists E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal E=\\langle E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(M;E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall N\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;E,R,+_E,0_E,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land N\\neq\\{0_E\\}\\to N\\cap M\\neq\\{0_E\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"M \\subseteq_e E","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"E(M)","display":false},{"tex":"E(M)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1611,"backlinks":[{"id":"a1509c5621540470","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EssentialExtension}_S$ (essential-extension predicate, see [[58-df-essential-extension]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-494","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-essential-extension.md|58-df-essential-extension]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["ef3a5dd6825f0373","4deff85a84639467"]}